 4/mcg_mount4-e1757000165605.jpg
UID:713saJ839o9k3vbPNYOzW
SUMMARY:Kathrine McGovern Day of Service
DTSTAMP:20260810T100230Z
DTSTART:20260915T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Known for her kindness and lifelong dedication to service\, Kat
	hrine G. McGovern\, along with her late husband\, John P. McGovern\, MD\, 
	helped shape Houston into the vibrant\, compassionate city it is today. \n
	On Tuesday\, September 15\, we invite you to celebrate her birthday by giv
	ing back to one of the places she loved most — the McGovern Centennial Gar
	dens. Bring your friends\, family\, and your spirit of service. Together\,
	 we’ll honor Mrs. McGovern’s memory in the most meaningful way: by caring 
	for the community she cherished. \nVolunteer with us and help continue her
	 legacy through gardening\, beautification\, and stewardship projects that
	 keep the Gardens thriving and welcoming to all. \nSign up for this sessio
	n in the McGovern Centennial Gardens HERE.\n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/even
	t/kathrine-mcgovern-day-of-service/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Conservancy
